{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# TypeII FlatSpace CountSinglet Tests\n\nExact Spin(10) singlet-multiplicity regression checks for the published D=10 table.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Needs[\"StringCode`\"];\nStringCode`InitStringCode[\n  <|\n    \"theory\" -> \"TypeII\",\n    \"CFT\" -> \"FlatSpace\",\n    \"conventions\" -> \"TypeII-Ashoke\",\n    \"bracket\" -> \"Flat\"\n  |>\n];\nNeeds[\"StringCode`OPE`TypeII`FlatSpace`CountSinglet`\"];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "allTestsPassed = True;\n\ntestReport[name_, cond_] := Module[{},\n  Print[name, \": \", If[TrueQ[cond], \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\n  If[!TrueQ[cond], allTestsPassed = False];\n  cond\n];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Regression Cases\n\nThese cases reproduce the published `D=10` column in `singlet-counts.png`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "expectedCounts = <|\n  {1, 1, 0} -> 1,\n  {2, 0, 1} -> 1,\n  {1, 1, 2} -> 2,\n  {2, 0, 3} -> 4,\n  {1, 1, 4} -> 10,\n  {2, 0, 5} -> 26,\n  {1, 1, 6} -> 76,\n\n  {4, 0, 0} -> 2,\n  {2, 2, 0} -> 3,\n  {3, 1, 1} -> 5,\n  {4, 0, 2} -> 11,\n  {2, 2, 2} -> 12,\n  {3, 1, 3} -> 31,\n  {4, 0, 4} -> 88,\n  {2, 2, 4} -> 91,\n\n  {5, 1, 0} -> 16,\n  {3, 3, 0} -> 19,\n  {6, 0, 1} -> 40,\n  {4, 2, 1} -> 45,\n  {5, 1, 2} -> 125,\n  {3, 3, 2} -> 130,\n  {8, 0, 0} -> 175,\n  {6, 2, 0} -> 196,\n  {4, 4, 0} -> 210\n|>;\n\ncomputedCounts = AssociationThread[\n  Keys[expectedCounts],\n  countSinglets @@@ Keys[expectedCounts]\n];\n\ntest1 = testReport[\n  \"Test 1 (published D=10 counts)\",\n  computedCounts === expectedCounts\n];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Additional Checks",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "symmetryInputs = {\n  {1, 5, 2},\n  {4, 2, 1},\n  {6, 0, 1},\n  {3, 3, 2}\n};\n\ntest2 = testReport[\n  \"Test 2 (chirality symmetry)\",\n  And @@ (\n    countSinglets @@ # === countSinglets[#[[2]], #[[1]], #[[3]]] & /@ symmetryInputs\n  )\n];\n\ntest3 = testReport[\n  \"Test 3 (basic vanishing cases)\",\n  countSinglets[1, 1, 1] === 0 &&\n    countSinglets[2, 0, 0] === 0\n];\n\nbad1 = Quiet[countSinglets[-1, 0, 0], {countSinglets::badarg}];\nbad2 = Quiet[countSinglets[1/2, 0, 0], {countSinglets::badarg}];\n\ntest4 = testReport[\n  \"Test 4 (invalid argument handling)\",\n  bad1 === $Failed && bad2 === $Failed\n];\n\nallTestsPassed",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  }
 ],
 "metadata": {
  "version": "1.0.0"
 }
}
